# Wired Product Surfaces

- No placeholder UI, fake composers, seed catalogs, or unwired controls. If it is visible, it must work end to end.
- Removing a feature includes removing its harness, settings, and leftover copy in the same change.
- Created state (skills, installs, settings) must appear without an app restart. Wire live refresh; do not require a restart as the happy path.
- Screenshot follow-ups verify the named UI. They are not a license to expand scope.

```text
# ❌ BAD — seed every provider in the model picker; composer chrome with no run
# ✅ GOOD — show only configured providers; every control is wired
```
